      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -120,
      "params": {
        "text": "King's tax demand (spec/systems/king.md func_036138). Cadence: nothing before turn 30; then a demand fires only when turn % interval == 0, interval shrinks 18->15->12->9 as the year passes 1600/1700/1750; skipped once tax>85. Raise delta=((diff&0xFE)<<1)+4, new rate=min(tax+delta,75) (hard cap 0x4B). Pretext by severity score: <650 wedding, <950 war, <1100 Navigation Act, else Stamp Act."
      }
